{"text":"human bonds matter. Another way you can get oxytocin is through acts of human generosity. An act of human generosity is defined as giving of your time and energy and expecting nothing in return. Money doesn't work, sorry. If I told you that this morning I gave a thousand dollars to charity, what would you think of me? You'd be like, good for you. What do you want a medal? But if I told you that last Saturday I gave up my day and I went and painted schools in the inner city, then what would you think? You'd be like, nice, cool, I should do more, right? The value of my labor, much less than a thousand dollars, could have hired many more people for a thousand dollars to go paint schools in the inner city. But you see, as human beings, we put a premium on time because it is an equal commodity and it is a non-redeemable commodity. You spend money, you make money, you spend time, you'll never get it back.","words":[{"text":"human","start":0.0,"end":0.88},{"text":"bonds","start":0.88,"end":1.58},{"text":"matter","start":1.58,"end":2.52,"punct":"."},{"text":"Another","start":4.16,"end":4.16},{"text":"way","start":4.16,"end":4.42},{"text":"you","start":4.42,"end":4.52},{"text":"can","start":4.52,"end":4.64},{"text":"get","start":4.64,"end":4.78},{"text":"oxytocin","start":4.78,"end":5.46},{"text":"is","start":5.46,"end":6.32},{"text":"through","start":6.32,"end":6.56},{"text":"acts","start":6.56,"end":6.88},{"text":"of","start":6.88,"end":7.18},{"text":"human","start":7.18,"end":7.46},{"text":"generosity","start":7.46,"end":8.02,"punct":"."},{"text":"An","start":9.26,"end":9.3},{"text":"act","start":9.3,"end":9.48},{"text":"of","start":9.48,"end":9.6},{"text":"human","start":9.6,"end":9.76},{"text":"generosity","start":9.76,"end":10.16},{"text":"is","start":10.16,"end":10.64},{"text":"defined","start":10.64,"end":11.08},{"text":"as","start":11.08,"end":11.36},{"text":"giving","start":11.36,"end":11.58},{"text":"of","start":11.58,"end":11.88},{"text":"your","start":1